        "summary": "A subset of the CHELSA V2.1 ( https://www.chelsa-climate.org/datasets ) climatic variables were aggregated to a daily 10 km * 10 km resolution and clipped to Europe plus a 250 km buffer. Provided variables are: Daily Mean Near-Surface Air Temperature (tas) Daily Maximum Near-Surface Air Temperature (tasmax) Daily Minimum Near-Surface Air Temperature (tasmin) Precipitation (prec, diffrent from 'pr' which is bias-corrected) Surface Downwelling Shortwave Flux in Air (rsds) Near-Surface Relative Humidity (hurs)",
